## WHIP IT (instrumental cover) for PULP/SKRED
#  158 BPM, E Mixolydian / E major, 80 bars (~2:32). Instrumental only.
#  Self-contained: drums are built-in waves 82-99.
#     [whip_it.sk] /ls      then:   play     (stop:  stop)
#
#  WHAT THE SOURCES SAID
#    - Tempo ~158-160 BPM, key E (Mixolydian colour)
#    - Iconic riff: low E E A B D (and close variants) played by guitar + bass + synth
#    - Motorik 4/4 beat, palm-muted chugs, short synth stabs
#    - Verse progression E5 – D – A, chorus C – G – D
#  GUESSES (edit freely)
#    - exact bar counts of sections
#    - placement of the higher “whip it” stabs and fill rolls
#    - mix levels
#  UNTESTED and UNHEARD at the time of writing.
#
#  VOICE MAP
#    v0 kick   v1 snare   v2 closed hat   v3 open hat   v4 clap   v5 crash
#    v6 bass / main riff (centre saw) + v7 detuned partner
#    v8 guitar-style chug (bright square)
#    v11 FM stab + v12 modulator
#    v13 high synth stab / “whip” accent
#    v24 pad LFO   v26-v27 pad prototype   v28-v37 pad pool (used sparingly)
#  DELAY BUSES
#    1  short slap on stabs
#    2  light wash on pad / lead
#  PATTERNS
#    0 conductor   1 kick   2 snare   3 hats   6 main riff
#    7 chorus bass/chords   8 chug   9 high stab   11 pad
#    13 snare roll   14 pump
#  SECTIONS (bars)
#     0-7   intro riff
#     8-23  verse 1
#    24-31  chorus
#    32-47  verse 2
#    48-55  bridge / “whip it good”
#    56-71  final chorus + riff
#    72-79  outro
# ======================================================================

[WHIP IT] puts
M 158 16

